# RIMSHIRE: the field's corners follow the four board tiles round the
# battle: crags close a corner in with cliffs (and an angled cut), woods
# have trees, dunes and lakes run sand or water along the edges.
game rimshire
cheat war 6
cheat cpu 1 -1
# THE KEEP, node (0,0): crags round three corners
cheat battle 0 0 0
expect quad0 == 1
expect walls > 0
expect cell_0_0 == 1
# a lake corner: water along the edges (MARSHMOOT, node (2,0))
cheat war 3
cheat cpu 1 -1
cheat battle 2 0 0
expect quad0 == 3
expect cell_0_0 == 3
expect cell_47_0 == 3
# woods (THE LONG LANE, node 1): trees, no cliffs
cheat war 1
cheat cpu 1 -1
cheat battle 1 1 0
expect quad0 == 0
expect walls == 0
expect trees > 0
